
<%- layout("boilerplate/boiler") %>

<div class="container py-5">
    <div class="text-center mb-5">
        <span class="badge bg-primary-subtle text-primary mb-3">
            Privacy & Security
        </span>
        <h1 class="fw-bold">Privacy Policy</h1>
        <p class="text-secondary">
            Learn how LinkPulse handles your information.
        </p>
        <small class="text-muted">Last updated: October 18, 2026</small>
    </div>

    <div class="row justify-content-center">
        <div class="col-lg-9">
            <div class="card border-0 shadow-sm rounded-4">
                <div class="card-body p-4 p-md-5">

                    <p>
                        Welcome to <strong>LinkPulse</strong>. This Privacy
                        Policy explains what information may be collected,
                        how it is used, and how it is protected when you use
                        our URL shortening and link management services.
                    </p>

                    <hr>

                    <h4 class="fw-bold mt-4">1. Information We Collect</h4>
                    <p>Depending on how you use LinkPulse, we may collect:</p>
                    <ul>
                        <li>
                            <strong>Account information:</strong>
                            username, email address, and authentication data
                            needed to manage your account.
                        </li>
                        <li>
                            <strong>Link information:</strong>
                            original URLs, shortened URLs, and campaign details
                            that you create.
                        </li>
                        <li>
                            <strong>Usage information:</strong>
                            link click counts and visit information used to
                            provide link analytics.
                        </li>
                        <li>
                            <strong>Technical information:</strong>
                            limited technical data processed by our hosting
                            provider or application when necessary to operate
                            and protect the service.
                        </li>
                    </ul>

                    <h4 class="fw-bold mt-4">2. How We Use Information</h4>
                    <p>We may use collected information to:</p>
                    <ul>
                        <li>Create and manage user accounts.</li>
                        <li>Generate and redirect shortened links.</li>
                        <li>Display link statistics and campaign information.</li>
                        <li>Maintain service security and prevent misuse.</li>
                        <li>Diagnose technical problems and improve reliability.</li>
                    </ul>

                    <h4 class="fw-bold mt-4">3. Link Analytics</h4>
                    <p>
                        LinkPulse may record click counts and visit-related
                        information when someone opens a shortened link.
                        The specific information recorded depends on the
                        application's implementation and configuration.
                    </p>
                    <p>
                        Do not use shortened links to distribute confidential
                        information unless you understand the privacy
                        implications of the destination and the service.
                    </p>

                    <h4 class="fw-bold mt-4">4. Sharing of Information</h4>
                    <p>
                        We do not intend to sell personal information. Data
                        may be processed by service providers that support
                        hosting, database storage, or application operation.
                        Information may also be disclosed when required by
                        applicable law or when necessary to protect the
                        service and its users.
                    </p>

                    <h4 class="fw-bold mt-4">5. Data Storage and Security</h4>
                    <p>
                        LinkPulse uses application and database systems to
                        store and process information. Reasonable measures
                        should be maintained to protect this information;
                        however, no internet-based system can guarantee
                        absolute security.
                    </p>

                    <h4 class="fw-bold mt-4">6. Data Retention</h4>
                    <p>
                        Information may be retained for as long as necessary
                        to provide the service, maintain link analytics,
                        resolve disputes, or meet legal obligations.
                        Retention periods depend on the type of information
                        and the application's actual configuration.
                    </p>

                    <h4 class="fw-bold mt-4">7. Your Choices</h4>
                    <p>
                        You should be able to contact the LinkPulse team to
                        request information about your account data or ask
                        questions about its handling. Requests may be subject
                        to identity verification and applicable legal
                        requirements.
                    </p>

                    <h4 class="fw-bold mt-4">8. Children's Privacy</h4>
                    <p>
                        LinkPulse is not intended to collect personal
                        information from children in violation of applicable
                        privacy laws. If you believe personal information
                        has been collected improperly, contact the project
                        team.
                    </p>

                    <h4 class="fw-bold mt-4">9. Changes to This Policy</h4>
                    <p>
                        This policy may be updated as LinkPulse develops.
                        Updates will be reflected on this page along with
                        a revised date.
                    </p>

                    <h4 class="fw-bold mt-4">10. Contact Us</h4>
                    <p>
                        For questions about this Privacy Policy, contact
                        the LinkPulse project team through the contact
                        method provided on the project's official page.
                    </p>

                    <div class="alert alert-light border rounded-3 mt-4 mb-0">
                        <small class="text-secondary">
                            This page is a project template, not legal advice.
                            Review it against the information your application
                            actually collects, stores, and shares before
                            publishing it as your official policy.
                        </small>
                    </div>

                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="text-center mt-4">
                <a href="/" class="btn btn-outline-primary rounded-pill px-4">
                    Back to Home
                </a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>
